<font size="3"><b>I made it! (Meg)</b></font><br>
<i>Posted 3/12 by steve</i><p><p>
<p>
Here I am in Birchington. Steve came to Heathrow last night, all the way from Kent, to meet me.  My laptop was stolen sometime in the one minute between when I came out of customs, saw Steve, and we greeted each other.  GONE!  With my ticket in the pocket. Today Steve and I had the COMPLETE tour of this amazing natural history museum.  I saw the piles of elepphant skins, giraffe skulls, a gazillion galago skeletons.  I banged my head on the three foot door just after Steve waltzed through it with no problem.  Steve is very happy here. It is heaven for him.  I'm happy too. The B and B is wonderful -- a half a block walk from the ocean.  We are having fun.  I hope Sandy is OK.  Dedie -- I forgot to give you her bed.  I'm sure she'll be OK.<br>
<br>
Gotta go 'cause other people use this phone line.<br>
<br>
Meg<br>
